AB  - As legal documents grow in complexity and in length, there comes an ever-increasing demand for an intelligent tool capable of helping legal professionals to efficiently review and analyze such content. This hereby-proclaimed Legal Document Analyzer sets itself apart by engineering an AI mechanism that combines the prowess of the Mistral-7B large language model with a sleek Gradio interface for ease of use. Uploading of PDF files is supported, making such tasks that used to be done by hand-aided contractors' review, legal research, risk assessment, or compliance-a piece of cake. In this manner, under the IoT conception of operation, mid-range hardware such as graphic cards on laptops can be used to retain the power necessary in running the model-4-bit quantization is implemented from the Bits And Bytes library-for the best trade-off between performance and computational efficiency. Our study concludes that this tool provides accurate, fast, and easy-to-use support for legal professionals, students, and researchers towards the educational realm and the more preliminary stages of an enterprise.
